{
    "title": "Live Satellite View, GPS Maps",
    "description": "Live Satellite View, GPS Maps and Voice navigation is a user-friendly driving directions app with a purpose to help travelers to exploring the live earth map of the world. The GPS maps voice navigation app is very easy to use, through updated free gps satellite map with property lines, HD street view maps, discovering unique locations and route maps. The 3D street view GPS navigation system allows users to get live driving directions free, geographic location with a compass, location navigator to find current location and traffic map to fetch live traffic updates. Plan your road trips with Live Satellite View Map app along with turn by turn GPS Voice navigation for all countries of the world with accurate driving direction finder feature to enjoy silky-smooth GPS navigation on live maps. Explore world maps satellite view along with world famous landmarks and visit the world using free GPS and maps for android integrated with map directions, and route directions features. The location finder helps find your live location (without compromising your privacy) & also helps tourists to search live address and nearby areas with smart gps satellite map app. With this Navigate live GPS maps go to get shortest routes with simple travel directions for earth map explore.\r\n\r\nLive Satellite View, GPS Maps key features;\r\nMap\u2019s navigation and transport guide\r\nSee satellite map live on mobile\r\nGPS road map live for finding destination\r\nLive trip updates and discover unique locations\r\nBest map for fastest route planner and free GPS for Android\r\nEarth map satellite live view for search gps nearest public places\r\nGPS speedometer trip meter will track the vehicle speed\r\nGPS navigation live map voice guide\r\n\r\n\r\nGPS VOICE NAVIGATION\r\nHere is a digital route planner voice over navigation app for accurate GPS map navigation with step-by-step voice directions. Tap to speak your destination and let the GPS route finder and route planner give the driving route on the mobile phone. Turn by turn GPS maps voice navigation make sure you stay on the right course. Get a driving route and touring map app with route optimizer to enjoy the hassle-free road trip with map satellite 360.\r\n\r\nGPS SATELLITE MAP \r\nExplore the globe map 3d with this live navigation map app 2023. High-resolution 3d maps will help in displaying GPS live earth view of the cities, roads, and buildings. Use live earth map satellite navigation to make a shortest route, earth map zoom in to view the places nearby, street view map of your favorite city or country, or even you can visit the street view live and buildings of the famous places with this free navigation app. \r\n\r\nTRAFFIC MAP\r\nPlanning a road trip? Get the latest update about traffic before going out. Don\u2019t get stuck in the traffic jam. Get GPS app Live Satellite View Map and easy GPS voice navigation during driving to save yourself from traffic stress. Plan a trip with this perfect GPS route planner. With the help of this Live Satellite View, GPS Maps and useful transit map app feature, you can change your driving route before time instead of ending up in traffic jams. \r\n\r\nCOMPASS\r\nFind the best compass clock in live satellite view map and GPS voice navigation app. This compass app is designed to save people from getting lost. Find gps and maps directions no matter where you are, even it can show accurate directions to hikers on hiking trail.\r\n\r\nCURRENT LOCATION\r\nThis GPS navigation location app will help you to find your live location and nearby places. Zoom GPS map to find the nearest public places and shortest gps navigation for trucks free. This GPS route finder will provide you the earth street view of the world map on your device during travel navigation. \r\n\r\nFAMOUS PLACES \r\nIf you are looking to find the driving route that leads you to your favorite places, use live earth 3d map app with satellite GPS visual maps to view from above to get directions. This live maps satellite view app offers everyone to find the STD code of their desired country.",
